      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_gush_Description": "Summons a gush of water to damage an enemy unit, reducing their movement speed and armor.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_gush_Lore": "During his championship of the Sunken Isles, Leviathan gained mastery over the open sea.",
