      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell": "Kraken Shell",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_Description": "Thickens Tidehunter's hide to passively block a portion of any incoming physical attack damage. Reduced block amount versus creeps. The hide also removes negative status effects if the damage taken crosses a threshold.\\n\\nCan be activated to double the block amount at the cost of %active_move_speed_penalty_pct%%% movement speed. Lasts %active_duration%s.\\n\\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_Facet_tidehunter_kraken_swell": "Kraken Shell gains permanent Damage Block when an enemy hero dies under the effects of Anchor Smash.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_Lore": "Claddish navymen tell tales of a mighty sea-faring beast that suffered spear and sword but continued to lay waste to the fleet.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_Note2": "Does not stack with items that provide Damage Block.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_damage_cleanse": "DAMAGE CLEANSE THRESHOLD:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_damage_reset_interval": "DAMAGE RESET INTERVAL:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_damage_reduction": "DAMAGE BLOCK:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_bonus_reduction_per_kill": "DAMAGE BLOCK PER KILL:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_kraken_shell_creep_reduction_penalty_pct": "%CREEP PENALTY:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash": "Anchor Smash",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_Description": "Tidehunter swings his mighty anchor to attack and deal bonus damage to nearby enemies and reduce their attack damage. The radius of Anchor Smash is Tidehunter's attack range plus %additional_range% units.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_Lore": "Stolen from one of Admiral Kunkka's flagships, Leviathan's heavy anchor proves useful as a melee weapon.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_Note0": "Anchor Smash works on all Ancient creeps except for Roshan.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_Note1": "Damage done by Anchor Smashes triggered by Kraken Shell Cleanse is considered reflected damage. Reflected damage does not provide any lifesteal and cannot be reflected.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_attack_damage": "ATTACK BONUS DAMAGE:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_anchor_smash_damage_reduction": "%DAMAGE REDUCTION:",
