      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_Description": "Slams the ground, causing tentacles to erupt in all directions, damaging and stunning all nearby enemy units.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_Lore": "Calling to the abyssal god Maelrawn has resulted in entire armadas being lost at sea.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_Note0": "Ravage will hit invisible units.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_Note1": "Ravage waves move outwards at a speed of %speed%.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_radius": "RADIUS:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_ravage_duration": "DURATION:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_blubber": "Blubber",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_blubber_Description": "Tidehunter's hide removes negative status effects if he takes more than %damage_cleanse% damage. Removes most debuffs, even if they are generally not purgable.\\n\\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_blubber_Note0": "Only damage from player owned sources is counted towards debuff removal.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_blubber_Note1": "The counter will reset if no player owned damage is taken for %damage_reset_interval% seconds.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_dead_in_the_water": "Dead in the Water",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_dead_in_the_water_Description": "Tidehunter attaches a heavy anchor to an enemy hero. The hero is leashed while attached to the anchor. Attempting to move more than %chain_length% units away from the anchor forces the hero to %max_movement_speed% move speed, dragging the anchor behind them. The anchor can be destroyed with %attacks_to_destroy% hero attacks.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_tidehunter_dead_in_the_water_Lore": "Anchors Aweigh!",
