      "DOTA_Tooltip_Ability_tidehunter_leviathans_catch_Description": "Whenever an enemy hero is killed by Tidehunter or dies under his debuffs, a fish appears in their place; Tidehunter can eat the fish to permanently gain %fish_health_bonus% Health, %fish_attack_range% Attack Range, and %fish_damage_block% Bonus Damage Block.<br><br>Tidehunter eats a free fish every time he reaches an even hero level.",
